# Superproject root ignores (S1-D6).
# NOTE: a submodule's .gitignore does not cover this root, and this file does not
# reach inside `server/` or `ux/` — each repo carries its own.

# Secrets — .env lives at the root next to Compose; this line is what keeps it
# out of history.
.env

